    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Daughter of the mage Martin D'Richet, Marie fell in love with Prince Marcel while touring New Orleans and, when he refused to Embrace her, sought out another vampire willing to do so. She was instead deceived and Embraced by the fugitive @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.jaYCq9rVOh0I9NCN]{Tremere} Antonio Calbullarshi, drawing a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.jaYCq9rVOh0I9NCN]{Tremere} death sentence down on them both. Marcel took her in despite his misgivings, but the Setites &mdash; sworn to destroy anything he values &mdash; ambushed her while she hunted with his childe Anthony. Christopher's timely rescue saved her body, but she has remained in unexplained, prolonged torpor ever since; Marcel suspects Setite sorcery is responsible and hunts for the truth.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>If ever roused, you are shy and trusting beneath a shell of feigned boldness and impulsiveness.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 2, Dominate 1, Thaumaturgy 2 (Movement of the Mind 1).</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Antonio Calbullarshi. Currently in extended torpor, body guarded at Marcel's home. Secrets rating: B.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
